{"type":"message","id":"571cc046","parentId":"1578fce2","timestamp":"2026-02-26T08:56:22.308Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"这是一个 Python 项目，有 main.py、test_todos.py、requirements.txt 和 todos.db。让我查看一下主要文件的内容来了解这个 API 的结构。","thinkingSignature":"308271c80e901f8cab0be1580333c45dcc85349ce64f40424fa16ce4d2281ea8"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_92qufq682sro_1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/todo-api/main.py"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_92qufq682sro_2","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/todo-api/SPEC.md"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_92qufq682sro_3","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/home/one/projects/todo-api/requirements.txt"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":562,"output":124,"cacheRead":7322,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8008,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772096178797}}
{"type":"message","id":"47da361d","parentId":"571cc046","timestamp":"2026-02-26T08:56:22.334Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_92qufq682sro_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\"\"\"\nTo-Do REST API - Main Application\n\"\"\"\nfrom datetime import datetime\nfrom typing import List, Optional\n\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI, HTTPException, Depends\nfrom pydantic import BaseModel\nfrom sqlalchemy import create_engine, Column, Integer, String, Boolean, DateTime\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.declarative import declarative_base\nfrom sqlalchemy.orm import sessionmaker, Session\n\n# Database setup\nDATABASE_URL = \"sqlite:///./todos.db\"\nengine = create_engine(DATABASE_URL, connect_args={\"check_same_thread\": False})\nSessionLocal = sessionmaker(autocommit=False, autoflush=False, bind=engine)\nBase = declarative_base()\n\n# SQLAlchemy Model\nclass Todo(Base):\n    __tablename__ = \"todos\"\n    \n    id = Column(Integer, primary_key=True, index=True)\n    title = Column(String(200), nullable=False)\n    description = Column(String, nullable=True)\n    completed = Column(Boolean, default=False)\n    created_at = Column(DateTime, default=datetime.utcnow)\n    updated_at = Column(DateTime, default=datetime.utcnow, onupdate=datetime.utcnow)\n\n# Create tables\nBase.metadata.create_all(bind=engine)\n\napp = FastAPI(title=\"To-Do API\", description=\"轻量级待办事项 REST API\")\n\n# Pydantic Models\nclass TodoCreate(BaseModel):\n    title: str\n    description: Optional[str] = None\n\nclass TodoUpdate(BaseModel):\n    title: Optional[str] = None\n    description: Optional[str] = None\n    completed: Optional[bool] = None\n\nclass TodoResponse(BaseModel):\n    id: int\n    title: str\n    description: Optional[str]\n    completed: bool\n    created_at: datetime\n    updated_at: datetime\n\n    class Config:\n        from_attributes = True\n\n# Dependency\ndef get_db():\n    db = SessionLocal()\n    try:\n        yield db\n    finally:\n        db.close()\n\n# Routes\n\n@app.get(\"/todos\", response_model=List[TodoResponse])\ndef get_todos(db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"获取所有待办事项\"\"\"\n    return db.query(Todo).all()\n\n@app.get(\"/todos/{todo_id}\", response_model=TodoResponse)\ndef get_todo(todo_id: int, db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"获取单个待办事项\"\"\"\n    todo = db.query(Todo).filter(Todo.id == todo_id).first()\n    if not todo:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Todo not found\")\n    return todo\n\n@app.post(\"/todos\", response_model=TodoResponse)\ndef create_todo(todo: TodoCreate, db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"创建待办事项\"\"\"\n    db_todo = Todo(title=todo.title, description=todo.description)\n    db.add(db_todo)\n    db.commit()\n    db.refresh(db_todo)\n    return db_todo\n\n@app.put(\"/todos/{todo_id}\", response_model=TodoResponse)\ndef update_todo(todo_id: int, todo: TodoUpdate, db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"更新待办事项\"\"\"\n    db_todo = db.query(Todo).filter(Todo.id == todo_id).first()\n    if not db_todo:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Todo not found\")\n    \n    if todo.title is not None:\n        db_todo.title = todo.title\n    if todo.description is not None:\n        db_todo.description = todo.description\n    if todo.completed is not None:\n        db_todo.completed = todo.completed\n    \n    db.commit()\n    db.refresh(db_todo)\n    return db_todo\n\n@app.delete(\"/todos/{todo_id}\")\ndef delete_todo(todo_id: int, db: Session = Depends(get_db)):\n    \"\"\"删除待办事项\"\"\"\n    db_todo = db.query(Todo).filter(Todo.id == todo_id).first()\n    if not db_todo:\n        raise HTTPException(status_code=404, detail=\"Todo not found\")\n    \n    db.delete(db_todo)\n    db.commit()\n    return {\"message\": \"Todo deleted\"}\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    import uvicorn\n    uvicorn.run(app, host=\"0.0.0.0\", port=8000)\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772096182330}}
{"type":"message","id":"c47676be","parentId":"47da361d","timestamp":"2026-02-26T08:56:22.344Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_92qufq682sro_2","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# To-Do API 设计规范\n\n## 技术栈\n- **框架**: FastAPI\n- **数据库**: SQLite (本地文件)\n- **ORM**: SQLAlchemy\n\n## 数据库表设计\n\n### 表: todos\n\n| 字段 | 类型 | 说明 |\n|------|------|------|\n| id | Integer | 主键，自增 |\n| title | String(200) | 待办事项标题 |\n| description | Text | 详细描述（可选） |\n| completed | Boolean | 是否完成，默认 False |\n| created_at | DateTime | 创建时间 |\n| updated_at | DateTime | 更新时间 |\n\n## API 端点设计\n\n### 1. 获取所有待办事项\n- **方法**: GET\n- **路径**: `/todos`\n- **响应**: `{\"todos\": [...]}`\n\n### 2. 获取单个待办事项\n- **方法**: GET\n- **路径**: `/todos/{id}`\n- **响应**: `{\"id\": 1, \"title\": \"...\", ...}`\n\n### 3. 创建待办事项\n- **方法**: POST\n- **路径**: `/todos`\n- **请求体**: `{\"title\": \"...\", \"description\": \"...\"}`\n- **响应**: `{\"id\": 1, \"message\": \"Todo created\"}`\n\n### 4. 更新待办事项\n- **方法**: PUT\n- **路径**: `/todos/{id}`\n- **请求体**: `{\"title\": \"...\", \"description\": \"...\", \"completed\": true}`\n- **响应**: `{\"message\": \"Todo updated\"}`\n\n### 5. 删除待办事项\n- **方法**: DELETE\n- **路径**: `/todos/{id}`\n- **响应**: `{\"message\": \"Todo deleted\"}`\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772096182341}}
{"type":"message","id":"6390050a","parentId":"c47676be","timestamp":"2026-02-26T08:56:22.350Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_92qufq682sro_3","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"fastapi==0.109.0\nuvicorn==0.27.0\nsqlalchemy==2.0.25\npydantic==2.5.3\npytest==7.4.4\nhttpx==0.26.0\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1772096182348}}
{"type":"message","id":"6784e1be","parentId":"6390050a","timestamp":"2026-02-26T08:56:41.164Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"好的，我现在了解了这个项目：\n- 这是一个 FastAPI 的 To-Do REST API\n- 使用 SQLite 数据库和 SQLAlchemy ORM\n- 已经有完整的 CRUD API\n\n现在用户想要为它添加一个简单的 Web 前端。我需要按照流程让所有 agent 参与：\n1. design-agent - 设计\n2. code-agent - 开发\n3. test-agent - 测试\n4. docs-agent - 文档\n5. review-agent - 审查\n\n让我开始协调工作。首先让 design-agent 进行设计。","thinkingSignature":"c395d81868bc5360ff01af961c6405e5a639e14b5da372365c747673071d08da"},{"type":"text","text":"了解了！这是一个 FastAPI + SQLite 的 To-Do REST API。现在开始协调全流程：\n\n## 🚀 开始：Web 前端开发项目\n\n**项目概述：** 为 todo-api 添加简单的 Web 前端\n\n让我先启动 **design-agent** 进行设计：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_7zb1axh7101p_1","name":"message","arguments":{"action":"send","channel":"webchat","message":"## 任务：To-Do Web 前端设计\n\n**项目背景：**\n- 现有 REST API：`/todos` (GET), `/todos/{id}` (GET), `/todos` (POST), `/todos/{id}` (PUT/DELETE)\n- 技术栈后端：FastAPI + SQLite + SQLAlchemy\n\n**任务：**\n1. 设计一个简单的 Web 前端页面，用于与 To-Do API 交互\n2. 功能需求：\n   - 展示待办事项列表\n   - 添加新待办\n   - 编辑待办（标记完成、修改内容）\n   - 删除待办\n3. 技术选择建议：纯 HTML/JS 或简单框架（Vue/React CDN 版本）\n\n请提供设计文档，包括：\n- 页面结构\n- UI/UX 简要说明\n- 技术选型\n- 前后端交互方式","target":"design-agent"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":2012,"output":389,"cacheRead":7322,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9723,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1772096182351}}
