{"type":"message","id":"140e9910","parentId":"9ee4d4e2","timestamp":"2026-02-26T09:06:55.522Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is repeating the same task they gave me earlier. I've already completed this task - I called all the agents in sequence:\n1. design-agent - completed the design\n2. code-agent - completed the development\n3. test-agent - completed testing\n4. docs-agent - completed documentation\n5. review-agent - completed code review\n\nAll agents have participated and the project is complete. Let me summarize the results for the user.","thinkingSignature":"291db5da9284d0708af629f40eab99401f92b85e9562e11dc49dd84bdd0c54c7"},{"type":"text","text":"## ✅ 项目已完成！\n\n我已经协调所有 agent 完成了 To-Do API 的 Web 前端开发。以下是完整的工作总结：\n\n### 📋 各阶段完成情况\n\n| 阶段 | Agent | 状态 | 结果 |\n|------|-------|------|------|\n| **设计** | design-agent | ✅ | 提供完整设计文档（技术选型、页面结构、API 交互） |\n| **开发** | code-agent | ✅ | 创建 static/index.html, style.css, app.js，添加 CORS |\n| **测试** | test-agent | ✅ | API 测试 5/5 通过，CORS 正常 |\n| **文档** | docs-agent | ✅ | 更新 SPEC.md，创建 README.md |\n| **审查** | review-agent | ✅ | 发现 5 个高优先级问题（含安全警告） |\n\n---\n\n### 📁 创建/修改的文件\n\n```\n/home/one/projects/todo-api/\n├── main.py           # 添加了 CORS 中间件 + 静态文件服务\n├── static/\n│   ├── index.html    # 主页面\n│   ├── style.css     # 紫色渐变主题样式\n│   └── app.js        # 前端交互逻辑\n├── SPEC.md           # 更新：添加前端设计\n└── README.md         # 新建：完整项目文档\n```\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ 代码审查发现的问题（需关注）\n\n1. **CORS 配置安全风险** - `allow_credentials=True` 时 origin 列表过宽\n2. **datetime.utcnow() 已废弃** - 需改用 `datetime.now(timezone.utc)`\n3. **Pydantic class Config 已废弃** - 需改用 `model_config`\n4. **onclick XSS 风险** - 建议使用事件委托\n5. **缺少输入验证** - title 建议添加长度限制\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 启动方式\n\n```bash\ncd /home/one/projects/todo-api\npython3 main.py\n```\n\n然后访问 **http://localhost:8000** 即可使用 Web 界面！\n\n需要我修复代码审查中发现的问题吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.1","usage":{"input":4,"output":520,"cac